GET http://localhost:3000/

### No Authorization header at all
GET http://localhost:3000/token

### Fake token
GET http://localhost:3000/token
Authorization: Bearer notarealtoken

### Wrong scheme (not Bearer)
GET http://localhost:3000/token
Authorization: Basic abc123

### Ticketmaster api US
@apiKey = {{$dotenv TICKETMASTER_API_KEY}}

GET https://app.ticketmaster.com/discovery/v2/events.json?keyword=Six&classificationName=Arts%20%26%20Theatre&city=Miwaukee&countryCode=US&stateCode=&apikey={{apiKey}}

### Ticketmaster api Global
GET https://app.ticketmaster.com/discovery/v2/events.json?keyword=mj&classificationName=Arts%20%26%20Theatre&countryCode=US&apikey={{apiKey}}